## 1. OBJECTIVE

Redesign ODIN into a **dual-plane routing system**:

### Plane A — Intent Routing (Deterministic)

* Converts input → structured intent
* Outputs stable routing decision

### Plane B — MCP Index Router (Meta-Orchestration Layer)

* Determines *where execution should be resolved*
* Does NOT execute logic
* Only resolves “which system should handle this”

### Overlay — Risk Signal (from AEGIS-2)

* Soft scoring layer
* Does NOT block execution
* Feeds routing adjustments

